  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It would be helpful to add a page to the wiki describing OSGi and how fedora could make use of it. This includes both the high level what? and why? of OSGi along with the functional capabilities it would provide. It would also include a description of what still needs to happen in order for Fedora to be deployable within an OSGi container.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
